dow-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 240\" class=\"mx-auto h-40 w-full max-w-[260px]\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Entering numbers into a form\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"120\" r=\"96\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent-soft))\"></circle><rect x=\"84\" y=\"46\" width=\"152\" height=\"150\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgb(var(--card))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--line))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><g><rect x=\"102\" y=\"66\" width=\"60\" height=\"7\" rx=\"3.5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"102\" y=\"78\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgb(var(--wash))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--line))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"110\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"rgb(var(--ink))\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">₹ <!-- -->1,20,000</text></g><g><rect x=\"102\" y=\"108\" width=\"60\" height=\"7\" rx=\"3.5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"102\" y=\"120\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgb(var(--wash))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--accent))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"110\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent))\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">₹ <!-- -->3,80,000</text></g><g><rect x=\"102\" y=\"150\" width=\"60\" height=\"7\" rx=\"3.5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"102\" y=\"162\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgb(var(--wash))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--line))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"110\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"rgb(var(--ink))\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">₹ <!-- -->95,000</text></g><path d=\"M214 150 l30 30 -10 4 8 14 -7 4 -8 -14 -8 8 z\" fill=\"rgb(var(--ink))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--card))\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-lg font-semibold\">1. Enter your numbers</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Every calculator opens with example numbers so you can see how it works. Replace them with your own figures from your books, POS or bank statements. Type plain numbers; commas are added for you (1,50,000).</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 240\" class=\"mx-auto h-40 w-full max-w-[260px]\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Results shown as a chart with a magnifying glass\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"120\" r=\"96\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent-soft))\"></circle><rect x=\"70\" y=\"58\" width=\"180\" height=\"124\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgb(var(--card))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--line))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"90\" y=\"128\" width=\"18\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent) / 0.3)\"></rect><rect x=\"120\" y=\"112\" width=\"18\" height=\"50\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent) / 0.4)\"></rect><rect x=\"150\" y=\"118\" width=\"18\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent) / 0.5)\"></rect><rect x=\"180\" y=\"96\" width=\"18\" height=\"66\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent) / 0.6000000000000001)\"></rect><rect x=\"210\" y=\"80\" width=\"18\" height=\"82\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent))\"></rect><path d=\"M92 116 L128 104 L156 108 L188 88 L222 70\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--sage))\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"></path><circle cx=\"226\" cy=\"150\" r=\"26\" fill=\"rgb(var(--card) / 0.6)\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--ink))\" stroke-width=\"6\"></circle><line x1=\"245\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"266\" y2=\"192\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--ink))\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><text x=\"226\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"rgb(var(--sage))\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">✓</text></svg><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-lg font-semibold\">2. Read your results</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Results update as you type. Each result shows the reference range, a coloured status and the rupee impact of any gap. On a phone, the key result stays pinned at the bottom of the screen; tap Results to jump to it.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 240\" class=\"mx-auto h-40 w-full max-w-[260px]\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A report being saved and shared\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"120\" r=\"96\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent-soft))\"></circle><rect x=\"92\" y=\"44\" width=\"116\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgb(var(--card))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--line))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"62\" width=\"64\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgb(var(--ink))\" opacity=\"0.85\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"82\" width=\"84\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"96\" width=\"60\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"110\" width=\"84\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"124\" width=\"60\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"138\" width=\"84\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgb(var(--muted-light))\"></rect><rect x=\"108\" y=\"158\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent))\"></rect><circle cx=\"226\" cy=\"72\" r=\"24\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent))\"></circle><path d=\"M216 78 l10 -12 10 12 M226 66 v18\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--accent-ink))\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"></path><circle cx=\"232\" cy=\"164\" r=\"22\" fill=\"rgb(var(--sage))\"></circle><path d=\"M222 164 l7 7 13 -14\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--card))\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-lg font-semibold\">3. Test, save and share</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Use Scenario mode to try a change (dish cost +10%, commission −3 points) without touching your inputs. Then save it on this device, share a link, or download a PDF or CSV for your partner or accountant.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"mt-16\" aria-labelledby=\"colours\"><h2 id=\"colours\" class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Reading your results</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-sage\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Green</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Within the reference range. Keep doing what you&#x27;re doing.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-caution\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Amber</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Slightly outside the range. Worth a look this month.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card\"><span class=\"mt-1 h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-danger\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Red</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Well outside the range, or a loss. Act on this first.</p></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg> Reference ranges are indicative. The right numbers for your outlet depend on format, city, cuisine and pricing.</p></section><section class=\"mt-16\" aria-labelledby=\"actions\"><h2 id=\"actions\" class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Buttons under every result</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-save h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.2 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.4.6l3.8 3.8a2 2 0 0 1 .6 1.4V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M17 21v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7\"></path><path d=\"M7 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Save</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Stores the numbers with a name you choose, on this device only. Find everything later under Saved scenarios (History).</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-open h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 14 1.5-2.9A2 2 0 0 1 9.24 10H20a2 2 0 0 1 1.94 2.5l-1.54 6a2 2 0 0 1-1.95 1.5H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H18a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Open a saved scenario</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">The drop-down under the buttons loads any scenario you saved for this calculator.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-share2 h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle><line x1=\"8.59\" x2=\"15.42\" y1=\"13.51\" y2=\"17.49\"></line><line x1=\"15.41\" x2=\"8.59\" y1=\"6.51\" y2=\"10.49\"></line></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Share</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Creates a link with your numbers inside it. Anyone with the link sees the same figures, so share it only with people you trust.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"15\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">PDF</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A clean report with your inputs, results, a chart, assumptions and reference ranges.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-spreadsheet h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M8 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M14 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M8 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M14 17h2\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">CSV</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Opens in Excel or Google Sheets. Menu Engineering can also import a CSV of your dishes.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-printer h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6\"></path><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Print</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Prints the results without menus and buttons.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-card transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lift\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Light or dark theme</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Use the sun/moon button in the top bar to switch between white &amp; blue and black &amp; gold. Your choice is remembered.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-16 grid items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl bg-inverse p-6 text-on-inverse sm:p-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr]\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 240\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[280px]\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A shield with a lock over a phone\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"120\" r=\"96\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent-soft))\"></circle><rect x=\"112\" y=\"40\" width=\"96\" height=\"164\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgb(var(--card))\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--line))\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"146\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"6\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgb(var(--line))\"></rect><path d=\"M160 74 l42 14 v30 c0 28 -18 46 -42 56 c-24 -10 -42 -28 -42 -56 v-30 z\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent))\"></path><rect x=\"144\" y=\"112\" width=\"32\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent-ink))\"></rect><path d=\"M150 112 v-8 a10 10 0 0 1 20 0 v8\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--accent-ink))\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"></path><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"124\" r=\"4\" fill=\"rgb(var(--accent))\"></circle><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"188\" r=\"14\" fill=\"rgb(var(--chart-5) / 0.45)\"></circle><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"186\" r=\"14\" fill=\"rgb(var(--chart-5))\"></circle><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgb(var(--card) / 0.6)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><text x=\"228\" y=\"191.04\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14.700000000000001\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"rgb(var(--card))\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">₹</text></g></svg><div><h2 id=\"privacy\" class=\"text-3xl font-semibold text-on-inverse\">Your numbers stay with you</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-on-inverse/75\">Calculations run in your browser. Nothing you type is sent to a server. Saved scenarios, your last inputs and theme choice are kept in this browser only. Share links carry your numbers inside the link itself.</p></div></section><section id=\"glossary\" class=\"mt-16 scroll-mt-24\" aria-labelledby=\"glossary-title\"><h2 id=\"glossary-title\" class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Glossary</h2><dl class=\"mt-6 grid gap-x-8 divide-y divide-line rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card px-6 shadow-card md:grid-cols-2 md:divide-y-0\"><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">Total cost</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Dish cost + Labour + Packaging cost for one order.</dd></div><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">Commissionable value (CV)</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Selling price − Discount + Packaging charge. Commission is worked out on this.</dd></div><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">GST on commission</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">18% GST the platform charges on its commission. Fixed, not an input.</dd></div><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">Payout</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">CV − Commission − GST on commission − Ads: what the platform sends to your bank. GST the customer pays on food isn&#x27;t included; the platform pays it to the government.</dd></div><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">Profit per order</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Payout − Total cost.</dd></div><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">Break-even price</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">The price at which a dish earns ₹0 after all deductions and costs.</dd></div><div class=\"py-4 md:border-b md:border-line\"><dt class=\"font-semibold\">Star / Plow Horse / Puzzle / Dog</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-soft\">Menu engineering categories from profit per unit and units sold compared with the menu averages.</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"mt-16\" aria-labelledby=\"help-faq\"><h2 id=\"help-faq\" class=\"text-3xl font-semibold\">Common questions</h2><div class=\"mt-6 divide-y divide-line rounded-3xl border border-line bg-card shadow-card\"><details class=\"group px-6 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Do I need to create an account?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">No. Everything works without login. Your numbers are calculated in your browser and saved only on your device.</p></details><details class=\"group px-6 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">Why do the calculators already show numbers?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">They are example numbers so you can see how each tool works. Press “Clear all” to start blank, or “Example” to bring them back.</p></details><details class=\"group px-6 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 font-medium\">I see a red message under a field. What do I do?<span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><p class=\"pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">It means the value can&#x27;t be used, for example a negative amount or a percentage above 100. Correct the number and the message disappears.</p></details><details class=\"